    "non_causality": "Correlation is not causation. These indicators are explanatory context for analysts, never a justification for enforcement targeting.",
    "protected_attributes": "scst_share and sex_ratio are included only to explain VICTIMIZATION/REPORTING patterns (e.g. atrocities against SC/ST, crimes against women). They must NEVER be read as group propensity to offend. Treat with the highest caution and human review.",
